#!/bin/bash
#PBS -N csdnet_pmo_v9_10k
#PBS -q v1_gpu72
#PBS -l select=1:ncpus=8:mem=48gb:ngpus=1:gpu_type=RTX6000
#PBS -l walltime=12:00:00
#PBS -o /path/to/CSDNet/logs/csdnet_pmo_v9_10k_out.log
#PBS -e /path/to/CSDNet/logs/csdnet_pmo_v9_10k_err.log
#PBS -M your.email@example.org

set -u -o pipefail

ROOT="${ROOT:-/path/to/CSDNet}"
cd "$ROOT"
mkdir -p logs CSDNet/exp/pmo/results

module load Python/3.10.8-GCCcore-12.2.0
source "${VENV_PATH:-$ROOT/.venv}/bin/activate"

export TOKENIZERS_PARALLELISM=false
export PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
export PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True
export TF_FORCE_GPU_ALLOW_GROWTH=true
export TF_CPP_MIN_LOG_LEVEL=3
export PYTHONPATH="$ROOT:${PYTHONPATH:-}"

SEED="${SEED:-0}"
TASK_INDEX="${TASK_INDEX:-1}"
ORACLE_REQUESTED="${ORACLE:-}"
CKPT_PATH="${CKPT_PATH:-csdnet_checkpoints_6m_safegpt_arocbi_100k/last.ckpt}"
DATA_DIR="${DATA_DIR:-csdnet_data/pubchem_10m_with_props_v2}"
ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR="${ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR:-}"
OUT_DIR="${OUT_DIR:-CSDNet/exp/pmo/results/safegpt100k_iterative_remask_v9_10k_seed${SEED}}"
MAX_CALLS="${MAX_CALLS:-10000}"
MAX_LEN="${MAX_LEN:-128}"
SKIP_DONE="${SKIP_DONE:-1}"
RUN_TAG="${RUN_TAG:-failed17}"
MODE="${MODE:-iterative_remask_v9}"
V5_MOTIF_POOL_SIZE="${V5_MOTIF_POOL_SIZE:-240}"
V9_PRIOR_POPULATION_SIZE="${V9_PRIOR_POPULATION_SIZE:-100}"
V9_PRESCREEN_ACTIVE_MOTIF_SIZE="${V9_PRESCREEN_ACTIVE_MOTIF_SIZE:-240}"
V9_ROOT_OVERGENERATE_FACTOR="${V9_ROOT_OVERGENERATE_FACTOR:-2.0}"
LEARNED_INSERTION_FRACTION_SCALE="${LEARNED_INSERTION_FRACTION_SCALE:-1.0}"

TASKS=(
    albuterol_similarity
    amlodipine_mpo
    celecoxib_rediscovery
    deco_hop
    drd2
    fexofenadine_mpo
    gsk3b
    isomers_c7h8n2o2
    isomers_c9h10n2o2pf2cl
    jnk3
    median1
    median2
    mestranol_similarity
    osimertinib_mpo
    perindopril_mpo
    qed
    ranolazine_mpo
    scaffold_hop
    sitagliptin_mpo
    thiothixene_rediscovery
    troglitazone_rediscovery
    valsartan_smarts
    zaleplon_mpo
)

if [ -n "$ORACLE_REQUESTED" ]; then
    ORACLE=""
    for TASK in "${TASKS[@]}"; do
        if [ "$TASK" = "$ORACLE_REQUESTED" ]; then
            ORACLE="$TASK"
            break
        fi
    done
    if [ -z "$ORACLE" ]; then
        echo "Unknown ORACLE: $ORACLE_REQUESTED"
        exit 1
    fi
    TASK_INDEX="name"
else
    if ! [[ "$TASK_INDEX" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then
        echo "TASK_INDEX must be an integer from 0 to 22. Got: $TASK_INDEX"
        exit 1
    fi
    if [ "$TASK_INDEX" -lt 0 ] || [ "$TASK_INDEX" -ge "${#TASKS[@]}" ]; then
        echo "TASK_INDEX must be 0..22. Got: $TASK_INDEX"
        exit 1
    fi
    ORACLE="${TASKS[$TASK_INDEX]}"
fi
LIVE_LOG="${LIVE_LOG:-logs/csdnet_pmo_v9_10k_${RUN_TAG}_${ORACLE}_seed${SEED}_live.log}"
mkdir -p "$OUT_DIR"
exec > >(tee -a "$LIVE_LOG") 2>&1

echo "CSDNet PMO iterative_remask_v9 10k task start: $(date)"
echo "Task index: $TASK_INDEX, oracle: $ORACLE, seed: $SEED"
echo "Checkpoint: $CKPT_PATH"
echo "Data dir: $DATA_DIR"
echo "Atomic length prior: ${ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR:-dataset-derived}"
echo "Output dir: $OUT_DIR"
echo "Max calls: $MAX_CALLS, skip completed: $SKIP_DONE"
echo "Mode: $MODE"
nvidia-smi --query-gpu=index,name,memory.total,memory.free --format=csv,noheader

if [ ! -f "$CKPT_PATH" ]; then
    echo "Cannot find checkpoint: $CKPT_PATH"
    exit 1
fi
if [ ! -d "$DATA_DIR" ]; then
    echo "Cannot find data dir: $DATA_DIR"
    exit 1
fi
if [ -n "$ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR" ] && [ ! -s "$ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR" ]; then
    echo "Cannot find atomic length prior: $ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR"
    exit 1
fi
if [ "$MODE" = "elastic_frontier_prescreen" ] || \
   [ "$MODE" = "elastic_frontier_prescreen_v2" ]; then
    ORACLE_VOCAB="CSDNet/exp/pmo/vocab/${ORACLE}.csv"
    if [ ! -s "$ORACLE_VOCAB" ]; then
        echo "Cannot find oracle-specific ZINC fragment prior: $ORACLE_VOCAB"
        exit 1
    fi
    VOCAB_ROWS=$(( $(wc -l < "$ORACLE_VOCAB") - 1 ))
    if [ "$VOCAB_ROWS" -lt 100 ]; then
        echo "Oracle-specific fragment prior is unexpectedly small: $VOCAB_ROWS rows"
        exit 1
    fi
    echo "Prescreened PMO protocol: oracle-specific ZINC prior=$ORACLE_VOCAB rows=$VOCAB_ROWS"
fi

python - <<'PY' || exit 2
import torch

if not torch.cuda.is_available():
    raise SystemExit("CUDA is not available inside the allocated PBS job")
x = torch.empty(1, device="cuda")
print("CUDA preflight passed:", torch.cuda.get_device_name(0), x.device)
PY

ARGS=(
    --mode "$MODE"
    --oracle "$ORACLE"
    --ckpt_path "$CKPT_PATH"
    --vocab csdnet_vocab.pkl
    --data_dir "$DATA_DIR"
    --output_dir "$OUT_DIR"
    --max_oracle_calls "$MAX_CALLS"
    --freq_log 100
    --seed "$SEED"
    --max_len "$MAX_LEN"
    --batch_size 32
    --candidate_batch_size 96
    --n_steps 90
    --population_size 100
    --elite_size 120
    --elite_seed_prob 0.5
    --motif_min_atoms 4
    --motif_max_atoms 36
    --remask_fraction 0.25
    --min_remask_tokens 2
    --span_prob 0.72
    --rdkit_check_interval 25
    --max_sample_retries 2
    --violation_neighborhood 2
    --temperature_start 1.15
    --temperature_end 0.20
    --temperature_power 1.5
    --v2_score_elite_fraction 0.35
    --v2_diversity_weight 0.20
    --v5_remask_fractions 0.06,0.14,0.28,0.50
    --v5_nonzero_threshold 1e-8
    --v5_rescue_temperature 1.65
    --v5_motif_pool_size "$V5_MOTIF_POOL_SIZE"
    --v5_score_elite_fraction 0.35
    --v5_diversity_weight 0.25
    --v8_graph_cut_rounds 6
    --v8_graph_edit_attempts 120
    --v9_prior_population_size "$V9_PRIOR_POPULATION_SIZE"
    --v9_prescreen_active_motif_size "$V9_PRESCREEN_ACTIVE_MOTIF_SIZE"
    --v9_warmup_calls 1000
    --v9_score_archive_size 84
    --v9_lineage_archive_size 36
    --v9_lineage_ucb_weight 0.04
    --v9_bandit_alpha 0.20
    --v9_bandit_temperature 2.0
    --v9_ucb_weight 0.30
    --v9_min_operator_multiplier 0.05
    --v9_root_bandit_alpha 0.15
    --v9_root_bandit_temperature 1.5
    --v9_root_ucb_weight 0.30
    --v9_root_overgenerate_factor "$V9_ROOT_OVERGENERATE_FACTOR"
    --v9_anchor_remask_fraction 0.10
    --v9_saturation_top10 0.90
    --v9_sparse_nonzero_rate 0.25
    --v9_stagnation_patience 800
    --v9_lineage_collapse_threshold 0.60
    --v9_empty_round_fallback 2
    --v9_max_empty_rounds 8
    --v9_frontier_min_scale 0.01
    --v9_delta_min_scale 0.03
    --v9_delayed_credit_alpha 0.05
    --v9_archive_percentile 0.90
    --learned_insertion_fraction_scale "$LEARNED_INSERTION_FRACTION_SCALE"
)
if [ -n "$ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR" ]; then
    ARGS+=(--atomic_length_prior "$ATOMIC_LENGTH_PRIOR")
fi
if [ "$SKIP_DONE" = "1" ]; then
    ARGS+=(--resume)
fi

STATUS=1
for ATTEMPT in 1 2; do
    echo "======================================================================"
    echo "V9 process attempt ${ATTEMPT}/2 for $ORACLE at $(date)"
    python -m CSDNet.exp.pmo.run "${ARGS[@]}"
    STATUS=$?
    if [ "$STATUS" -eq 0 ]; then
        break
    fi
    echo "V9 failed with status=$STATUS; retrying from a clean task in 60 seconds."
    sleep 60
done

if [ "$STATUS" -ne 0 ]; then
    echo "V9 failed after two attempts: oracle=$ORACLE seed=$SEED"
    exit "$STATUS"
fi

python - "$OUT_DIR" "$ORACLE" "$SEED" "$MAX_CALLS" "$MODE" <<'PY' || exit 3
import sys

from CSDNet.exp.pmo.run import completed

output_dir, oracle, seed, max_calls, mode = sys.argv[1:]
if not completed(
    output_dir,
    mode,
    oracle,
    int(seed),
    int(max_calls),
):
    raise SystemExit(
        f"Completion verification failed: oracle={oracle}, expected calls={max_calls}"
    )
print(f"Completion verified: oracle={oracle}, calls={max_calls}")
PY

python -m CSDNet.exp.pmo.summarize_pmo_progress \
    --output_dir "$OUT_DIR" \
    --mode "$MODE" \
    --seed "$SEED" \
    --expected_calls "$MAX_CALLS" || true

echo "CSDNet PMO iterative_remask_v9 10k task done: oracle=$ORACLE seed=$SEED time=$(date)"
